# Application Insights (SDK) sink — configuration UI placeholder.
# Flat form: every field on its own row, no collapsible sections.
#
# Sink kind: application_insights_sdk
#
# This is the SDK-flavoured variant. It uses the official
# Microsoft.ApplicationInsights SDK (TelemetryClient → TraceTelemetry
# / ExceptionTelemetry) and is the drop-in replacement for
# Serilog.Sinks.ApplicationInsights.
#
# Pick this sink if you want idiomatic AI telemetry types or if you
# already use the AI SDK elsewhere in your app. Pick
# application_insights_http instead if you want a narrow dependency
# graph or AOT-clean publishing without the AI SDK.

